{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustivity model:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events collected from the underlying authority’s unified "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callback accumulate in an internal queue. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".strict"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the store reports events left pending at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deallocation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"assertNoPendingEvents()"},{"type":"text","text":" is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isolated "},{"code":"deinit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unknown test"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rather than to the test that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each test with an explicit "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It runs the strict check with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterTestStore","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterActionSequence","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterActionStep","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterTestRuntime","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterTestClock","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterTestRequest","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterTestPendingWork","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterScenarioRecorder","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterScenarioFixture","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/RouterScenarioControl","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.testing\/documen